oke-width="2"></rect><rect x="-92" y="-158" width="316" height="316" stroke="#273a4d" stroke-opacity="0.42" stroke-width="2"></rect><rect x="-64" y="-136" width="272" height="272" stroke="#dbe8f0" stroke-opacity="0.58" stroke-width="15"></rect><rect x="-36" y="-114" width="228" height="228" stroke="#273a4d" stroke-opacity="0.42" stroke-width="2"></rect><rect x="-8" y="-92" width="184" height="184" stroke="#273a4d" stroke-opacity="0.42" stroke-width="2"></rect></g><path fill="url(#_R_2mhr_-light)" d="M0 0h1400v1200H0z"></path><text x="54" y="1137" fill="#f3f6f7" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="21" letter-spacing="1">KIKORA / STUDIO</text><text x="1145" y="1137" fill="#f3f6f7" font-family="monospace" font-size="14">FORM STUDY — 001</text></svg><span class="k_5993a0c_reflection" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="k_5993a0c_padBack" role="img" aria-label="A dark grey base concept on the underside of the glass mousepad" aria-hidden="true"><span class="k_5993a0c_baseMat"></span></div></div><div class="k_5993a0c_surfaceLabel" aria-hidden="true"><span></span>ARTIST — 001</div></div><div class="k_5993a0c_stageBottom"><p>Drag to explore · Arrow keys work too</p><span aria-hidden="true">↔</span></div><p id="_R_3_-instructions" class="k_5993a0c_srOnly">Use left and right arrows to turn, up and down to tilt, and Home to reset.</p><div class="k_5993a0c_faceControls"><div role="group" aria-label="Choose a side"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">Artwork side</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">Underside · Base</button></div><p id="_R_3_-base-note">Underside concept only. The custom base pattern, material and final construction are still to be confirmed.</p></div></section><div class="k_5993a0c_controls"><div class="k_5993a0c_presets" role="group" aria-label="Choose a view"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true"><span>0<!-- -->1</span>Overview</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span>0<!-- -->2</span>Surface</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span>0<!-- -->3</span>Edge</button></div><div class="k_5993a0c_sliders"><label for="_R_3_-tilt"><span>Tilt<output>46<!-- -->°</output></span><input id="_R_3_-tilt" type="range" min="10" max="76" value="46"/></label><label for="_R_3_-turn"><span>Rotation<output>-12<!-- -->°</output></span><input id="_R_3_-turn" type="range" min="-35" max="35" value="-12"/></label><button type="button" class="k_5993a0c_reset">Reset view<!-- --> ↺</button></div></div><div class="k_5993a0c_galleryColumn"><div class="k_5993a0c_exhibitCaption"><div><span>KIKORA / ORIGINAL ABSTRACT STUDY</span><h2>Another sense of space.</h2><p>Blue-grey, light, and layers of geometry.</p></div><span class="k_5993a0c_swatches" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><p class="k_5993a0c_conceptNote">An original visual study. Collaborating artists and final editions have not yet been announced.</p></div><section class="k_5993a0c_gallery" aria-label="Artist concept gallery"><div class="k_5993a0c_story"><div class="k_5993a0c_storyIntro"><span>Step into the story</span><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></div><article class="k_5993a0c_chapter"><span class="k_5993a0c_chapterNumber">01</span><p class="k_5993a0c_eyebrow">A POINT OF VIEW</p><h2><span>Every artist has</span><span>a world of their own.</span></h2><p class="k_5993a0c_body">A character’s expression. A style you would recognise anywhere. A story still taking shape. We want each piece to hold on to its creator’s perspective, and give you something to connect with.</p><span class="k_5993a0c_rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></article><article class="k_5993a0c_chapter"><span class="k_5993a0c_chapterNumber">02</span><p class="k_5993a0c_eyebrow">FROM IMAGE TO OBJECT</p><h2><span>Art to look at.</span><span>Art to live with.</span></h2><p class="k_5993a0c_body">A composition finds its way onto glass. Its edges, empty spaces and viewing distance take on new meaning. Artist editions explores how a work of art can become part of the desk you return to each day.</p><dl class="k_5993a0c_dimension"><dt>Design dimensions</dt><dd>490 × 420 mm</dd></dl><p class="k_5993a0c_specNote">Thickness, surface finish and base construction are in development.</p></article></div></section><section class="k_5993a0c_invitation"><span class="k_5993a0c_eyebrow">KIKORA / OPEN STUDIO</span><div><h2>Your world could be next.</h2><p>Independent artist or original IP creator? Share your portfolio and tell us what you would love to make.</p><a href="/pages/contact">Start a collaboration conversation<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section><nav class="k_5993a0c_next" aria-label="Keep exploring"><span>Keep exploring</span><a href="/pages/glass-core"><small>THE ESSENTIALS</small>Core glass<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/glass-covers"><small>MUSIC, REIMAGINED</small>Cover series<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav></main><footer class="k_45aaab5_footer"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerGrid"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerBrand"><a aria-label="KIKORA home" href="/"><span class="k_c22ae38_identity "><svg class="k_c22ae38_symbol" viewBox="8 4 112 112" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18 52 64 22 108 39 89 52 66 43 38 61 38 90 18 82Z"></path><path d="M66 76 90 60 110 68 66 97Z" opacity=".55"></path><path d="M48 69v21l18 7v-21Z" opacity=".83"></path></svg><span class="k_c22ae38_word"><svg class="k_3489a55_wordmark " viewBox="0 0 306 40" role="img" aria-label="KIKORA" focusable="false"><path d="M0 0h9v15h6L29 0h12L23 19l20 21H30L15 25H9v15H0Z"></path><path d="M66 0h9v40h-9Z"></path><path d="M101 0h9v15h6l14-15h12L124 19l20 21h-13L116 25h-6v15h-9Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M167 0h22l10 10v20l-10 10h-22l-10-10V10Zm4 9-5 5v12l5 5h14l5-5V14l-5-5Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M208 0h30l10 10v10l-8 8 10 12h-12l-11-12h-10v12h-9Zm9 9v11h17l4-4v-3l-4-4Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m260 40 14-40h15l14 40h-11l-3-10h-16l-3 10Zm16-18